*  DATA DIVISION - choreography
*
*  K path time x y z [roll]       keyframe; path = scene * 100 + object
*                                 (object 99 camera eye, 98 camera target)
*  B scene shooter target t0 count gap hit spread speed ramp boom [sx sy sz tx ty tz]
*                                 burst of laser fire; shooter/target 0 = a point
*                                 in the scene frame; the last shot of a hit=1
*                                 burst destroys the target (boom = blast size)
*  X scene time object kill size [x y z]
*                                 explosion: kill=1 destroys the object, else a
*                                 point in that object's frame (or the scene's)
*
*  Objects: 2-5 friendly fighters, 6-11 enemy fighters, 12/13 cruiser halves.
*  Frames: scenes 1-2 world, 3-4 and 8 the formation's moving frame,
*  5-7 the cruiser's frame (x starboard, y up, z towards the bow).
*
